@ 10.3.11.2 - Proto-Southern Vanuatu to Proto-Erromango
# citation: thetha, from Lynch, John (2001), The Linguistic History of Southern Vanuatu
	mʷ pʷ bʷ vʷ > m p b v
	v > p / #_
#	v > f / C:[+ sibilant]%
#	v > f / %C:[+ sibilant]
	r > *L (some sort of lateral?) / occasionally
	s {c,*j} > h s
	o > a
	u i > o e
	a > i / _CV:[+ high]
	# “many word medial vowels lost”